# Pairs with SingleParentMutation. Two links mutating the parents at once corrupt the separator order.
MODULE: RootIgnoresLinkGate
TARGET: SingleParentMutation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root hands a link on while another link holds its link gate
PERTURBS: RootTakeLinkGate

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "root"
    /\ lg = "none"
    /\ lg' = o
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "root"
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is not awaited
    /\ lg' = o
--- END
